		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(550, 20, 300, 140)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">Chapter 7. Build the photos first with `make animals`. Pretrained ImageNet is frozen, so only its new last layer learns from 150 pictures; training takes about 7 seconds. The dataset paths are absolute.</text>
